<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
  <dict>
    <key>items</key>
    <array>

      <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSGroupCell</string>
        <key>footerText</key>
        <string>把收到的通知横幅移到灵动岛下方，避免被灵动岛挡住。两项只能开一个，同时开会以「自动修正」为准。</string>
      </dict>
      <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSSwitchCell</string>
        <key>default</key>
        <false/>
        <key>defaults</key>
        <string>com.ethxnn88.visibleislandprefs</string>
        <key>key</key>
        <string>notificationFix</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>自动修正通知位置</string>
        <key>PostNotification</key>
        <string>com.ethxnn88.visibleislandprefs-updated</string>
      </dict>

      <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSGroupCell</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>自定义通知位置</string>
        <key>footerText</key>
        <string>如果你给灵动岛用了自定义位置，这里也要跟着调，否则横幅会被挡。</string>
      </dict>
      <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSSwitchCell</string>
        <key>default</key>
        <false/>
        <key>defaults</key>
        <string>com.ethxnn88.visibleislandprefs</string>
        <key>key</key>
        <string>notEnabled</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>使用自定义通知位置</string>
        <key>PostNotification</key>
        <string>com.ethxnn88.visibleislandprefs-updated</string>
      </dict>
      <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSEditTextCell</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>横向偏移</string>
        <key>prompt</key>
        <string>输入横向偏移（负数向左）</string>
        <key>bestGuess</key>
        <string>0</string>
        <key>placeholder</key>
        <string>0</string>
        <key>isNumeric</key>
        <false/>
        <key>PostNotification</key>
        <string>com.ethxnn88.visibleislandprefs-updated</string>
        <key>defaults</key>
        <string>com.ethxnn88.visibleislandprefs</string>
        <key>key</key>
        <string>xNot</string>
      </dict>
      <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSEditTextCell</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>纵向偏移</string>
        <key>prompt</key>
        <string>输入纵向偏移（正数向下）</string>
        <key>bestGuess</key>
        <string>40</string>
        <key>placeholder</key>
        <string>40</string>
        <key>isNumeric</key>
        <false/>
        <key>PostNotification</key>
        <string>com.ethxnn88.visibleislandprefs-updated</string>
        <key>defaults</key>
        <string>com.ethxnn88.visibleislandprefs</string>
        <key>key</key>
        <string>yNot</string>
      </dict>
      <dict>
        <key>action</key>
        <string>applyNow</string>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSButtonCell</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>立即应用</string>
        <key>defaults</key>
        <string>com.ethxnn88.visibleislandprefs</string>
      </dict>

    </array>
    <key>title</key>
    <string>通知横幅</string>
  </dict>
</plist>
